{"item_id": "BM0588", "position": 588, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_25", "anon_id": "M-25-021", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "p <- matrix(c(0.08,0.12,0.04, 0.15,0.22,0.11, 0.05,0.18,0.05), nrow = 3, byrow = TRUE)\nxv <- 1:3; yv <- 0:2\nEXY <- sum(outer(xv, yv) * p)\nEX <- sum(xv * rowSums(p)); EY <- sum(yv * colSums(p))\nanswer <- EXY - EX * EY", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "Uses the joint pmf to compute E[XY] - E[X]E[Y]."}
